<!-- Started from Kodi 22's bundled Estuary (skin.estuary, GPL-2.0-or-later; see LICENSE-Estuary.txt).
     Bald: the popup surface with settings-style rows (Bald_ConfigureButton), the rules list on a quiet 10% ink field
     and pill actions. Kodi binds 2 (heading), 10 (rules), 12, 13-19, 22-25 and 20 / 21 (OK / Cancel); every id,
     label and route is Estuary's. -->
